        1991,
        1932,
        2254
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "If you have already commented on the bill, you may attach a copy of said comment and send it to Mr. Curran in Albany. Please note, however, that some bills may have been amended subsequent to your comment. This will necessitate a restudy of the bill and perhaps a new comment.",
